※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4615 LANG_ARENA_VALUE_GIVEN_BACK

※ An `if` with no `else` has a way through that runs no arm, and along it a name keeps what it
※ had -- so the old value's arena is still one the name may be made in.

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let s0: mut arena = ⎕arena
    let s1: mut arena = ⎕arena
    defer ⎕empty(s1)
    let c: bool = false
    let x: mut str = "a" ⧺ "b" in s0
    if c:
        x ← "c" ⧺ "d" in s1
    ⎕empty(s0)
    if x = "ab": 0u6 else: 1u6
